      "widgets_values": [
        "## Fibo 2 Edit Turbo\n\n1. Upload an image.\n2. Enter an edit instruction, or a VGL JSON caption with `edit_instruction`.\n3. Run. The result is saved automatically.\n\nDefaults: **1024 \u00d7 1024**, **4 steps**, **CFG 1**, Euler / simple, seed 1234. For your source aspect ratio, set width and height to 0 to use an automatic trained bucket around 1 megapixel. Fixed dimensions resize and center-crop the input.\n\nThis simple local workflow has no prompt-enhancer or external API dependency. The original upstream template with its optional enhancer is preserved in the source package. This package covers single-image edits; it does not add mask or multi-reference presets.\n\nFibo model weights \u00a9 BRIA AI, **CC BY-NC 4.0**. Commercial use requires a separate Bria agreement. Qwen encoder and FLUX.2 VAE retain their component licenses. See the package's THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.\n\nDerived from Comfy Org's MIT-licensed Fibo 2 Turbo template."
      ]
    }
